        321,
        185,
        492,
        908
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Translate into Greek using the hints below to guide you:\nA young man had an old man for a father. The young man's name was Bdelykleon, the old man's Philokleon. The old man, it happened, had a terrible disease – he never stopped wanting to judge in the law-courts. The young man tried to persuade him not to judge, but the old man would not obey him, for all his persuasion. Finally, the young man locked him in the house. The old man was in despair and tried to escape, using all sorts of arguments. But he was not able to escape without being seen by the slaves, who guarded the house.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": {
        "id": "1",
        "instruction": "Translate into Greek using the hints below to guide you:",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "1",
            "prompt": "A young man had an old man for a father. The young man's name was Bdelykleon, the old man's Philokleon. The old man, it happened, had a terrible disease – he never stopped wanting to judge in the law-courts. The young man tried to persuade him not to judge, but the old man would not obey him, for all his persuasion. Finally, the young man locked him in the house. The old man was in despair and tried to escape, using all sorts of arguments. But he was not able to escape without being seen by the slaves, who guarded the house."
          }
        ]
      },
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
